{# Persistent amber alert on a case that went through an annulment request, is now
   final, and has no date for the communication of the ruling given on that request.
   That ruling is what made the payment order final (CPC art. 1024 para. 8), so the
   three years of CPC art. 705 para. 1 run from its communication (para. 2).

   The visibility test mirrors LegalCaseRepository::findAwaitingAnnulmentRulingCommunicationDate:
   the case is the same one the agenda lists under a blockage, so the two screens can
   never disagree about whether the date is needed. The passage through IN_ANULARE is
   read from the status history, because the case has already left that place by the
   time the date is asked for. #}
{% from 'case/overview/_icons.html.twig' import icon_warning %}

{% set is_final = case.status.value == 'DEFINITIVA' %}
{% set date_missing = case.annulmentRulingCommunicationDate is null %}

{% if is_final and date_missing and case.hasPassedThroughAnnulment() %}
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-900/40 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/20 px-4 py-3 mb-4 flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center size-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/40 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 shrink-0">
            {{ icon_warning('size-4') }}
        </span>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200">{{ 'case_overview.deadlines.alert_set_annulment_ruling_date_title'|trans }}</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300/80 mt-0.5">{{ 'case_overview.deadlines.alert_set_annulment_ruling_date_hint'|trans }}</div>
        </div>
        <button type="button"
                data-hs-overlay="#hs-modal-set-annulment-ruling-communication-date"
                class="py-1.5 px-3 inline-flex items-center text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-amber-600 text-white hover:bg-amber-700 transition shrink-0">
            {{ 'case_overview.deadlines.alert_set_annulment_ruling_date_cta'|trans }}
        </button>
    </div>
{% endif %}
